  "description": "SCK Group is delighted to present this spacious 2-bedroom apartment with 1 bathroom available for rent!\n\nExplore this wonderful property featuring two generous double bedrooms. The apartment showcases a semi-integrated kitchen and a comfortable, roomy living-dining area, with a lovely view. The two-bedroom has access to a long and bright balcony. \n\nThe entire apartment has recently been freshly painted, giving it a renewed and appealing look. Additionally, the bathroom has been modernised. Moreover, the property comes furnished with brand new furniture. \n\nJust two-minute walk to St Patrick’s Park, perfect location into city centre, which offers a wide variety of cafes, restaurants, and pubs to explore.\n\nDon’t miss the chance to make this place your home!\n\n*****E-mail enquiries only*****\n\nDISCLAIMER: Due to the high volume of applications we receive, we may not be able to respond to all inquiries. We wish you the best of luck in your property search.\n",
